    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village was once called Bullfrog Station because of the numerous bullfrogs found in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dousman%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dousman's local baseball team is still called the Frogs, and the town hosts an annual frog jumping competition.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
